  "title": "The Hackett Group® Partners with ServiceNow to Help Enterprises Accelerate ROI-based AI Transformation",
  "summary": "The Hackett Group® has partnered with ServiceNow to help enterprises accelerate ROI-driven AI transformation. As a Consulting and Implementation partner in the ServiceNow Partner Program, The Hackett Group® combines Hackett AI XPLR™ with the ServiceNow AI Platform to identify high-impact opportunities, prioritize investments and scale workflow transformation. Together, we’re helping organizations move beyond AI experimentation to faster execution and meaningful business value.",
